# Under safe mode, each line's body is still safe-checked: an unsafe escape
# hatch in eval'd code is rejected (the safe import propagates into the line).
>>> {"op":"eval","code":"import language.experimental.safe"}
~ "ok":true

>>> {"op":"eval","code":"val r = evalLoop[String] { (ctx, s) => val v = s.eval[String](\"(1: Any).asInstanceOf[String]\"); s.complete(v) }"}
~ "ok":false.*(asInstanceOf|rejectSafe|safe)
